§ `The lives -- transfer duty`

-- c051: 13.63 x 1200 above $500 000 (Schedule 2 Division 2, metropolitan or Peel, includes a home); not nil.
-- c081: 28453 + 5.15 x 5750 = 58065.50 (the life expects 55185). d037: 28453 + 5.15 x 8750 = 73515.50.
-- d055: 28453 + 5.15 x 34750 = 207415.50 (the life expects 207378). c094 at an assumed 800000: 28453 + 5.15 x 750.
-- k074: nil at the concessional rate (390000 is under the 500000 nil band); the off-the-plan window shut on 30 June 2026.
